// Title: UAC Bypass Using Iscsicpl - ImageLoad
// Rule ID: 9ed5959a-c43c-4c59-84e3-d28628429456
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548.002
// Category: image_load
// Product: windows
